    "agent_final_response": "\n\nPerfect! I've successfully completed all the requested tasks:\n\n## Summary of Actions Completed:\n\n1. **Found the case**: Located the case \"Database Migration Issue\" (ID: d2612ce3-c7c0-11f1-b74e-ee18f99d1ded) in the CRM.\n\n2. **Found the contact**: Located Marcus Webb's contact record (ID: d2612a63-c7c0-11f1-b74e-ee18f99d1ded) at DataStream Analytics.\n\n3. **Linked the case to the contact**: Created a relationship between the case and Marcus Webb's contact record using the \"contacts\" link field.\n\n4. **Updated the case description**: Added \"Linked to contact: Marcus Webb\" to the case description while preserving the original description about the database migration issue.\n\n5. **Sent confirmation email**: Successfully sent an email to marcus.webb@datastreamanalytics.com confirming that their support case has been assigned and they will receive updates.\n\nThe case is now properly linked to Marcus Webb's contact record, and they have been notified via email about their support case status.",
